+
+<template>
+  <!-- No `role="alertdialog"`, no `aria-modal`. A group with the sentence as its name says
+       exactly what is true: two controls that belong together, named by the question. The
+       sentence is rendered text AND the group's name, so nothing is announced twice. -->
